Package: bootlace
Title: Bootstrap Inference and Plots for Logistic, Emax and Cox Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Justin", "Wilkins", email = "justin.wilkins@occams.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides case-resampling bootstrap for fitted binomial GLMs,
    logistic Emax exposure-response models and Cox proportional hazards
    models, returning percentile confidence intervals for the model
    parameters. Companion functions plot response curves with bootstrap
    confidence ribbons and observed outcomes, forest plots of model
    effects, adjusted survival curves, and ROC curves for one or more
    models. Also provides visual predictive checks of Cox models against
    observed Kaplan-Meier curves, and backwards stepwise model reduction
    by likelihood ratio test.
